  keySpec: "Androgynous  \xB7  International Docking Standard"
  summary: "The forward bay cover protects the docking adapter and parachutes during
    launch and re-entry. The mechanism beneath is androgynous \u2014 both spacecraft
    carry an identical unit and either can be the active partner."
  whyItMatters: Docking happens in two stages. Soft capture uses magnets and sprung
    latches to absorb the residual closing velocity; only then does hard capture
    pull the vehicles into a pressure-tight seal.
